  "statement": "For the hash-pinned A1 production coefficients and A10-A13 strict sharp cubes, all prior A13 reductions remain binding at T4. R-079 closes the exact expectation-level full frame-current and canonical safe-packet Doob decomposition, and R-080 closes both regular no-revisit low objects plus far square completion. R-081 splits the heat-averaged production current exactly into a quadratic polynomial channel and one nonlinear Cartan quotient-vector channel. The polynomial far channel vanishes; the Cartan current has deterministic relative-gap decay, but its martingale-root sum is half-derivative critical. Vector-valued Doob--Burkholder interpolation proves the adapted input budget and gain ledger only for an explicitly factorised first-order NEAR response. The complete nonlinear coefficient has an additional upper-triangular conditional Jensen defect, witnessed even when d_jA=d_jDA=0; that defect, the lower-chaos-complete operator, and the signed control--control branch remain. Bounded-simple temporal packets admit causal Douglas factorisation and preserve the complete R-079 algebra despite range overlap, but an exact one-mode witness proves that the R-075 one-shot graph is not progressive-dense. Root-resolved FAR, complete adapted/signed NEAR, the overlap-stable full-progressive extension, controlled-shell one-use, and q=10/9 Nelson remain open.",
  "scope": "PROVED-STRUCTURAL-TRANSLATION-UNIVERSAL-Q-BALANCED-JET-A7-RECONSTRUCTION-BACKWARD-HEAT-NPC-CONE-TIP-SAFE-HARVEST-ENDPOINT-LIFTED-CAUSAL-WICK-DOOB-ONE-FORM-LINEAR-PHASE-KERNEL-DIAGONAL-OFFDIAGONAL-TELESCOPE-RESONANT-PHASE-ORBIT-BESOV-INVARIANT-CURRENT-PRINCIPAL-TAYLOR-FIXED-CUTOFF-GRAPH-RECOVERY-SIGNED-TRANSPORT-BESOV-CAUSAL-PACKET-PAYLOAD-COMPARABLE-HESSIAN-DIFFERENCE-FULL-SAFE-PACKET-FRAME-CURRENT-DOOB-REGULAR-LOW-OBJECT-FAR-SQUARE-CARTAN-TAIL-ADAPTED-NEAR-AND-TEMPORAL-PACKET-REDUCTIONS-WITH-EXECUTED-NOGOS@FIXED-FLOOR-SHARP-CUBE on L=16 for the A1 production symbol and coefficients, three complex components in the six-real convention, rho_regularizer=1e-12, exact non-aliased Fourier products, common bounded entrywise-real-even scalar regulators, covariance-matched A7 Wick subtraction, and the A10-A13 dyadic rectangular-cube filtration. R-080 low absorption is restricted to mutually orthogonal strict-past one-shot whole-shell controls with no later low-range revisit and fixed sufficiently large j0; its constants are J-uniform but may depend on j0 and the floor. R-081's current split, deterministic spatial tail, explicitly factorised first-order vector budget, exact secant-plus-Jensen decomposition, temporal factorisation, and non-density theorem are exact in their declared finite-cutoff scopes. They do not prove the root-resolved FAR sum, an estimate for the nonlinear Jensen-defect branch, the complete adapted/signed NEAR lower bound, overlap-stable progressive packet lower bound, extension to every finite-energy drift, controlled-shell one-use, Nelson, cutoff or floor removal, or any measure theorem.",
