  "no_overclaim": "R-081 proves the exact production polynomial/Cartan current split, far disappearance of the polynomial channel, a deterministic relative-gap current theorem, fixed-coefficient injection reduction and half-derivative method boundary, the vector-valued adapted input budget and gain ledger for an explicitly factorised first-order NEAR response, the exact secant-plus-Jensen decomposition and nonlinear d_jA factorisation no-go, the absolute control--control pair-high no-go, temporal packet factorisation and complete-packet algebraic temporalisation, and exact one-shot graph non-density. It does not estimate the upper-triangular nonlinear Jensen-defect branch, prove the root-resolved FAR sum, the adapted lower-chaos-complete NEAR operator, the signed control--control NEAR lemma, the complete regular packet lower bound, an overlap-stable progressive packet lower bound, extension to every finite-energy progressive/revisit drift, controlled-shell energy one-use, q=10/9 Nelson, any measure theorem, cutoff or floor removal, infinite volume, phase transition, BCC selection, Sector-A closure, or any T5, T6, or T7 promotion.",
  "next_action": "Prove the complete root-resolved FAR martingale paracomposition estimate retaining derivative injection, value innovation, heat compensator, square, trace, and forest. In NEAR, use the exact secant-plus-Jensen decomposition: estimate the explicitly factorised first-order branch in the vector budget and keep the upper-triangular Jensen defect with the lower-chaos-complete square--trace--forest operator and production-specific signed control--control balanced-root branch. Then prove an overlap-stable bounded-simple complete-packet lower bound uniformly in time mesh and revisit multiplicity, followed by the fixed-cutoff Boue--Dupuis admissible-core/truncation and lower-semicontinuity extension. Only then assemble controlled-shell one-use and the conditional q=10/9 Nelson synthesis.",
