  "notes": "Scoped T4 analytic/exact reduction plus executed adversarial diagnostics. A13-CLASSII-CARTAN-TAIL-ADAPTED-NEAR-TEMPORAL-REDUCTION (R-081) sharpens every R-080 frontier. Exact production algebra removes the polynomial far channel and leaves one nonlinear Cartan quotient-vector channel. A deterministic relative-gap theorem holds for every 0<s<1, but a rootwise sum repeats the critical X^(1/2)Y^(1/2) budget; fixed-coefficient injection is H^(1/2)-endpoint and H^(1/2-) alone fails. Vector-valued Doob--Burkholder interpolation proves the exact budget only for an explicitly factorised first-order NEAR response. An executed production witness has d_jA=d_jDA=0 but nonzero coefficient innovation, and the exact repair is a secant plus an upper-triangular conditional Jensen defect that remains in the signed complete packet. Absolute control--control pair-high extraction is also supercritical. Temporal Cauchy--Douglas factorisation and martingale orthogonality extend the complete R-079 algebra to overlapping bounded-simple packets, with the nonzero injected/future cross term executed in both audits, while a one-mode witness proves that the R-075 graph is not progressive-dense. Primary 60/60, non-importing independent 47/47, integrated 148/148, and aggregate 255/255 pass under the strengthened manifest count contract. The final eleven-page PDF has zero overfull boxes, no forms, and final-render visual QA. T-050 remains in progress at root-resolved FAR, complete adapted/signed NEAR, overlap-stable progression, controlled-shell one-use, and Nelson synthesis. Tier stays T4."
